  "bodyHash": "3112cf898c77d104",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Supplemental Patches</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplemental-patches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jedlimlx/supplemental-patches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"Issue Tracker\" style=\"padding-left:5px\"></a>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://supplemental-patches.pages.dev/assets/banner.png\">\n<br>\nSupplemental Patches 讓使用者能夠透過資源包，為模組方塊、實體、物品、粒子等建立自訂著色器（Shader）。該模組預設內建一個資源包，支援眾多熱門模組。</p>\n<p>若已安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Patches</a>，這些額外的著色器將自動整合至其中。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>本模組最<em>令人興奮</em>的功能包含（針對玩家）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>超過 500 個高品質著色器，適用於眾多熱門模組的自訂材質（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjadens-nether-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden's Nether Expansion</a>）。完整列表請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fmod_list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</li>\n<li>基於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderscape</a> 的末地氛圍，打造專屬的末地星雲天球</li>\n<li>靈感源自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doom and Gloom</a> 的酷炫霧氣效果</li>\n<li>修復多個模組的著色器問題（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fendergetic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endergetic Expansion</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fupgrade-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdoom-gloom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doom and Gloom</a>）</li>\n<li>修正物品著色器在方塊實體上顯示時的渲染問題（例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a> 的展示台與物品架）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有關可整合至 Euphoria Patches 的支援範圍詳細資訊，請參考此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教學</a>。</p>\n<h2>常見問題</h2>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>是否會移植至 (Neo)Forge 與 Fabric 以外的載入器？ <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可能不會。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>是否會推出舊版移植？ <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可能不會。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>你們能支援 XXX 模組嗎？ <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>一切都會按部就班進行。或者，您也可以自行製作。更多細節請參閱此 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252ftutorials%252fgetting_started\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">教學</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>我發現了一個錯誤。 <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>請先向我回報，不要打擾 Complementary Shaders / Euphoria Patches 的開發者。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>我新增的著色器沒有顯示出來。 <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>請確認資源包已載入後，嘗試重新載入著色器包。或者，使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feuphoria-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Companion</a> 模組檢查該方塊的渲染層級。某些方塊（例如部分玻璃方塊）可能會被渲染為裁剪（cutouts）而非半透明方塊。您需要透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsupplemental-patches.pages.dev%252fdocumentation%252fproperties.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">block.properties.json</a> 更改其渲染層級。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>內建的著色器無法運作。 <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>同樣地，請嘗試重新載入著色器包，並確認內建資源包已載入。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>這能與 OptiFine 搭配使用嗎？ <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>不行。本模組僅相容於 Oculus / Iris。</p>\n<p><strong>問：</strong>我可以將它放入我的整合包嗎？ <br>\n<strong>答：</strong>可以，請隨意使用。</p>",
